---

---

<section class="section arch-section" id="architecture">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="section-tag">架构</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">守护进程是执行的唯一权威</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        React UI 只渲染状态和发送命令。任务执行、恢复、调度、权限、记忆与编排全部由本地守护进程负责，同一运行时也服务非
        Tauri 应用。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="diagram reveal" role="img" aria-label="CodeY 架构：客户端通过本地协议连接守护进程，守护进程持有任务存储并驱动 Agent Harness 能力层">
      <div class="tier tier-clients">
        <div class="node node-client">
          <span class="node-title">React 桌面 UI</span>
          <span class="node-sub">Tauri 命令桥</span>
        </div>
        <div class="node node-client">
          <span class="node-title">TypeScript SDK</span>
          <span class="node-sub">@codey/agent-sdk</span>
        </div>
        <div class="node node-client">
          <span class="node-title">Python SDK</span>
          <span class="node-sub">codey_agent_sdk</span>
        </div>
        <div class="node node-client">
          <span class="node-title">Rust 客户端</span>
          <span class="node-sub">codey-agent-client</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="connector">
        <span class="connector-label">本地 IPC · Agent Runtime 协议（Unix Socket / 命名管道）</span>
      </div>

      <div class="tier">
        <div class="node node-daemon">
          <div class="daemon-main">
            <span class="node-title">CodeY 守护进程</span>
            <span class="node-sub">任务生命周期 · 持久调度 · 权限 · 恢复 · 记忆 · 编排</span>
          </div>
          <div class="daemon-store">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6">
              <ellipse cx="12" cy="6" rx="7" ry="2.6"></ellipse>
              <path d="M5 6v12c0 1.44 3.13 2.6 7 2.6s7-1.16 7-2.6V6"></path>
            </svg>
            SQLite 任务存储（WAL）
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="connector">
        <span class="connector-label">Agent Harness</span>
      </div>

      <div class="tier tier-caps">
        <span class="cap">模型</span>
        <span class="cap">工具与执行</span>
        <span class="cap">MCP · Skill · Plugin</span>
        <span class="cap">上下文与记忆</span>
        <span class="cap">子 Agent · 团队 · 后台</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="arch-notes reveal">
      <li>UI 生命周期不构成执行权威，桌面端断开或重启不影响任务状态。</li>
      <li>事件先持久化，客户端再投影为会话、进度、文件差异、产物与权限提示。</li>
      <li>外部副作用不承诺 exactly-once，未知结局显式进入待恢复状态，而不是被静默吞掉。</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .arch-section {
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .diagram {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .tier {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .tier-clients {
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .node {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 14px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .node-client {
    flex: 1 1 0;
    min-width: 150px;
  }

  .node-title {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .node-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--fg-faint);
  }

  .connector {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    padding: 26px 0;
  }

  .connector::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 50%;
    width: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1), rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.6), rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1));
  }

  .connector-label {
    position: relative;
    align-self: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--accent-bright);
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 4px 14px;
  }

  .node-daemon {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 20px 28px;
    border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.45);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.09), rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.02));
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.08);
  }

  .daemon-main {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .daemon-main .node-title {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .daemon-main .node-sub {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .daemon-store {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    border: 1px dashed var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .tier-caps {
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cap {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .arch-notes {
    margin: 48px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .arch-notes li {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    padding: 14px 0 14px 26px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    position: relative;
  }

  .arch-notes li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 4px;
    top: 24px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .node-daemon {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .daemon-main {
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
